    "storage": "/dev/shm (tmpfs, memory-backed: fsync is a no-op) and ~/.cache (ext4 on LVM on a QEMU disk on a ZFS pool of 4x WD Blue SA510 SATA SSDs without power-loss protection, behind a PERC H730P)"
  },
