  "gpu_host_link": "n/a",
  "network": "loopback (127.0.0.1), sender and ingest on the same guest",
  "core_plan": "per socket: core index 0 housekeeping (vCPU 0 and 12, unused by the pipeline; the occupancy monitor runs on vCPU 0), 1 ingest, 2 store, 3-6 feature workers, 11 sender. Pipeline vCPUs: 1-6, 13-18",
  "store": "/dev/shm (tmpfs) to keep disk noise out of CPU-jitter measurements; R8 order kept (store, then ack)",
  "workload": "60 s of the default 64-channel layout (seed 2026), 51,072,000 samples, 13,856 windows; 'realtime' = paced at 851,200 samples/s, 'unpaced' = as fast as ingest accepts",
  "metrics": "latency_us in microseconds; window_compute = time of features::reference for one window (stretched by interrupts or preemption); ring_transit = ingest push to store pop; ingest_to_ack includes the 100 ms storage batch by design; interrupts_per_cpu_per_s from /proc/interrupts deltas (all sources, and LOC local timer alone)",
  "commands": [
    "cd paralanes/experiments/per-socket-pipeline && cargo build --release",
    "for r in 1 2 3; do ./target/release/per-socket-pipeline --layout step-metrics --store-dir /dev/shm/psp --seconds 60 --realtime; ./target/release/per-socket-pipeline --layout step-metrics --store-dir /dev/shm/psp --seconds 60; done"
  ],
  "kind": "CPU throughput strategy, benchmark step 2 (+ isolation), docs/cpu-throughput-strategy.md \u00a79",
  "date": "2026-11-22",
  "changed_from_step1": "guest isolation only: kernel cmdline isolcpus=managed_irq,domain,1-11,13-23 nohz_full=1-11,13-23 rcu_nocbs=1-11,13-23 irqaffinity=0,12; workqueue cpumask 001001 (CPUs 0 and 12); kernel.perf_event_paranoid=1; guest rebooted. Same binary (built at paralanes 8dc37c9), same command, same core plan.",
  "guest_settings": "verified after boot: /sys/devices/system/cpu/isolated = nohz_full = 1-11,13-23; /proc/irq/default_smp_affinity 001001. Kernel-managed virtio queue interrupts (virtio3 net queues, virtio4-request disk queues) stay on per-CPU vectors including some pipeline CPUs (1,3,6,13,15,16,17,18) and cannot be moved",
  "host_settings": "unchanged from step 1 (Proxmox defaults; host tasks not restricted from the pinned host cores)",
